    "preamble": "R.Backialakshmi vs The Food Safety Officer on 22 November, 2024 W.P.(MD).No.23287 of Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 22.11.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice K.Kumaresh Babu W.P.(MD).No.23287 of 2017 and W.M.P.(MD)No.19571 of 2017 R.Backialakshmi ...Petition Vs 1.The Food Safety Officer, Ambasamudram, Tirunelveli District. 2.The Adjudicating Authority, The District Revenue Officer, Tirunelveli District. ... Respond Prayer: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution o India praying this Court to issue a Writ of Certiorari, to call for records relating to the impugned order passed by the second respond in Na.Ka.N2/2735/2014 case no.2/2013 dated 23.11.2017 and quash the same. For Petitioner : Mr.R.Parthiban For Respondents : Mr.J.K.Jayaseelan Government Advocate 1/3 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.(MD).No ORDER R.Backialakshmi vs The Food Safety Officer on 22 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/143767437/ He also made an endorsement to that effect.",
